        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa kila wakati mfalme alipoingia nyumbani mwa BWANA, wakaja walinzi wakazichukua, wakazirudisha tena chumbani mwa walinzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
